es for determining the font within a credit or direction.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"font names. The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vs. a music font.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MXLFont","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlfont","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLFont"}]}}}